window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>I finally have the life I’ve always dreamed of.</i></p> <p>Growing up in Stone Brook with my aunt and uncles, I wanted nothing more than to find my place in this world. I longed to discover more about my missing past and make sense of my wild magic. Little did I know those answers would come with so many more questions.</p> <p>My nightmares are now a reality as the forces against my men and I tear us apart. Heaven and Hell are colliding, the shadows are circling, and the enemy is closing in. But I’m no stranger to the dark.</p> <p>Thankfully, I’m not alone this time. I will do everything in my power to keep those I love safe, and God help anyone who tries to take them from me.</p> <p><b>Knight Unchained is the final book in the Black Veil University and has a HEA. This is a university-aged, Paranormal RH romance which means there will be no choosing between love interests at the end of the story.</b></p> <p><b>This series has darker elements that listeners should be aware of such as, strong language, PTSD from kidnapping, assault, and violence.</b></p>"; 
